        "pattern": "take something to heart",
        "meaning_cn": "把……放在心上；认真对待（批评等也可使人介意、难过）",
        "definition_en": "to take something seriously or be deeply affected by it, often becoming upset by criticism",
        "usage_note": "不同于take heart鼓起勇气；take criticism to heart。",
        "boundary": "建议可指认真听取；批评常指介意或难过。不同于 take heart（鼓起勇气）。",
        "direction": "R+P",
        "level": "L2"
      },
