        "pattern": "your heart goes out to somebody",
        "meaning_cn": "向某人深表同情",
        "definition_en": "to feel strong sympathy for somebody",
        "usage_note": "Our hearts go out to them；不是实际器官移动。",
        "boundary": "Our hearts go out to them；不是实际器官移动。",
        "direction": "R+P",
        "level": "L2"
      },
      {
