        "pattern": "set your heart on something",
        "meaning_cn": "一心想得到或做某事",
        "definition_en": "to want something very much",
        "usage_note": "也可have your heart set on；on后可接名词或doing。",
        "boundary": "也可have your heart set on；on后可接名词或doing。",
        "direction": "R+P",
        "level": "L2"
      },
