        "pattern": "to your heart’s content",
        "meaning_cn": "尽情地；想做多少就做多少",
        "definition_en": "as much as you wish",
        "usage_note": "She read to her heart’s content；不是心里的内容。",
        "boundary": "She read to her heart’s content；不是心里的内容。",
